                                                          ! Int J Chem Kinet 38:250??75, (2006)
CH2CO + C2H3 = C2H3COCH2           2.0e+11 0.0 2010.      ! Analogy with c2h4 + c2h3, Weissman and Benson, IJCK (1989) 
