                                                          ! Analogy with ch2o + ho2
                                                          ! Eiteneer & Frenklach JPCA 102: 5196-5205 (1998)                                                    
hex5enal + HO2 = HX1N6*O3J + H2O2 6.8e+03 2.50 10113.8   ! Rate rule for secondary allylic H, 
