H1N5OJ6Al + OH = HX1N5Q6AL         1.81e+13 0.    0.          ! Addition of oh to o of c-o.Analogy with ch3o + oh in NIST. W. Tsang Methane Review, J. Physc. Chem Chem Phys. (1986)                                                                                          
C4H7CHO-4 + HCO = H1N5OJ6Al        1.32e+4  2.48  6130.       ! Addition of hco to c of c=o. Analogy with c2h4 + c2h5 = pc4h9.H.J. Curran, Int J Chem Kinet 38:250??75, (2006)
